flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[/Read n/]
    B --> C{n is negative?}
    C -->|Yes| D[/Print Not a palindrome/]
    D --> Z([Stop])
    C -->|No| E[original ← n, reverse ← 0]
    E --> F{n > 0?}
    F -->|Yes| G[d ← n mod 10]
    G --> H[reverse ← reverse × 10 + d]
    H --> I[n ← n div 10]
    I --> F
    F -->|No| J{original = reverse?}
    J -->|Yes| K[/Print Palindrome/]
    J -->|No| L[/Print Not a palindrome/]
    K --> Z
    L --> Z
